asn1c 18e56503 runtime, APER: a SEQUENCE's extension bitmap leaked when the
input ended inside the bitmap or before the alignment that follows it: two
early returns did not free it. Found by the M14 fuzz smoke (LeakSanitizer)
in NGAP, F1AP, E1AP and XnAP. Row KS-PLAT-D5.

